          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.48,
          "end": 41.617,
          "en": "And we'll see how we can animate that with CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.617,
          "end": 43.53,
          "en": "and also Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 47,
          "en": "And then we'll also see where we need more support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47,
          "end": 50.163,
          "en": "from Vue side and how we get that support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.08,
          "end": 54.97,
          "en": "So how can we animate things? Let's start simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.97,
          "end": 59.08,
          "en": "Let's say we want to click this animate button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.08,
          "end": 61.16,
          "en": "And well, then this square here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.16,
          "end": 64.05,
          "en": "this block should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.05,
          "end": 66.42,
          "en": "And for that, we can go back to our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.42,
          "end": 69.42,
          "en": "To App.vue which is where I have this block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.42,
          "end": 71.31,
          "en": "This div with the class block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "And we'll start by adding a click listener to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 76.88,
          "en": "Sort of we can write some Vue code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.88,
          "end": 79.42,
          "en": "that should do something with that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.42,
          "end": 81.78,
          "en": "And I wanna start very, very simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.78,
          "end": 85.35,
          "en": "I wanna start by simply moving that block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.35,
          "end": 88.39,
          "en": "a little bit to the left, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.39,
          "end": 92.273,
          "en": "To achieve this we can add a new method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.00999999999999,
          "end": 97.75999999999999,
          "en": "Animate block, sounds like a fitting name for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.75999999999999,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "And that's the method which should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 102.12299999999999,
          "en": "upon a click. So let's wire this up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "And I wanna manage some data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.39,
          "en": "which basically controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.39,
          "end": 109.97,
          "en": "wherever we wanna animate the block or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.97,
          "end": 112.66,
          "en": "So whether we clicked the button or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.66,
          "end": 117.66,
          "en": "Animated block is the data property I will add for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.8,
          "end": 121.113,
          "en": "And it's a simple Boolean and starts with a false value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.06,
          "end": 124.43,
          "en": "Now that's just one way of implementing this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.43,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "but this is a very simple demo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 128.22,
          "en": "which we can build like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.22,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "So we get the animated block data property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 132.97,
          "en": "in the App.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.97,
          "end": 136.68,
          "en": "And we can now utilize this data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 140.56,
          "en": "to add a CSS class to this div conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.56,
          "end": 144.42000000000002,
          "en": "Because we can animate things in web development",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.42000000000002,
          "end": 149.42000000000002,
          "en": "with just CSS. We don't technically need JavaScript for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 153.75,
          "en": "We might just need JavaScript to start the animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.75,
          "end": 156.13,
          "en": "to add certain CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.13,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "But thereafter, CSS can do that on its own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 163.96,
          "en": "So here we could add a dynamic class binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.96,
          "end": 167.11,
          "en": "to bind the animate class let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.11,
          "end": 168.76,
          "en": "This class name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.76,
          "end": 171.2,
          "en": "Whenever animated block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.2,
          "end": 174.29,
          "en": "So this newly added data property is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.29,
          "end": 177.323,
          "en": "When that's true, the animate class will be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "And we can now define this animate class here in our styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 186.01,
          "en": "I'll add a brand new class animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.01,
          "end": 188.09,
          "en": "And to move the block around,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.09,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "we can for example use the transform CSS property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 193.82,
          "en": "which is a built in CSS property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.82,
          "end": 196.28,
          "en": "Has nothing to do with Vue.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.28,
          "end": 199.48,
          "en": "and there we can add translate X",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.48,
          "end": 202.69,
          "en": "to move an element around on the X axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.69,
          "end": 205.6,
          "en": "And the transform property is perfect for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.6,
          "end": 209.35,
          "en": "because it moves elements in an optimized way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.35,
          "end": 211.89,
          "en": "It gives us great performance essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.89,
          "end": 215.573,
          "en": "So here we could move it by, let's say, 50 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 216.92000000000002,
          "end": 218.38,
          "en": "So now to finish this up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 218.38,
          "end": 221.35,
          "en": "we just need to go to this method we added before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.35,
          "end": 224.63,
          "en": "and set this animated block equal to true here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.63,
          "end": 227.28,
          "en": "And with all of that, with that property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.28,
          "end": 230.46,
          "en": "which be used to add the animate class dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.46,
          "end": 233.32999999999998,
          "en": "and that animate class to find down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.32999999999998,
          "end": 234.7,
          "en": "With all of that set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.7,
          "end": 237.67000000000002,
          "en": "If we save that we can click animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.67000000000002,
          "end": 240.37,
          "en": "and we see that block move a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.37,
          "end": 244.54,
          "en": "We can actually also move it a bit further by for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.54,
          "end": 247.853,
          "en": "deducting 150 instead of 50 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 251.51,
          "en": "But what you'll see of course is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.51,
          "end": 255.43,
          "en": "this is an instant jump. It's not an animation at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.43,
          "end": 259.89,
          "en": "It's just a instant jump to its new position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.89,
          "end": 261.49,
          "en": "Now this is not what I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.49,
          "end": 263.5,
          "en": "I want a smooth animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.5,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "And implementing that is super easy with CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 270.17,
          "en": "We can simply go to this block class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.17,
          "end": 274.04,
          "en": "which is the base CSS class this div has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 274.04,
          "end": 276.83,
          "en": "And on that block class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.83,
          "end": 279.49,
          "en": "we can add the transition CSS property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.49,
          "end": 282.95,
          "en": "Which is another built in property CSS offers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 282.95,
          "end": 284.973,
          "en": "It has nothing to do with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.24,
          "end": 289.69,
          "en": "The transition property takes a couple of values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.69,
          "end": 292.2,
          "en": "It first of all wants to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 292.2,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "which other CSS property we wanna transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.08,
          "end": 296.913,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.913,
          "end": 300,
          "en": "we could say that we want to animate the opacity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300,
          "end": 303.05,
          "en": "But here on this block, we're never changing the opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.05,
          "end": 304.94,
          "en": "so this makes no sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.94,
          "end": 308.36,
          "en": "We can say all, to animate any changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.36,
          "end": 311.63,
          "en": "in any animatable CSS properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.63,
          "end": 315.72,
          "en": "Or we target transform specifically since we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.72,
          "end": 319.42,
          "en": "that we're going to change the transform property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.42,
          "end": 321.37,
          "en": "Initially on this base class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.37,
          "end": 323.97,
          "en": "we're not saying anything about transform.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.97,
          "end": 328.78,
          "en": "And then later we set it to translate X -150 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.78,
          "end": 330.3,
          "en": "So when that kicks in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.3,
          "end": 333.35,
          "en": "transition with the transform value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.35,
          "end": 338.35,
          "en": "tells CSS that any changes applied to the transform property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.96,
          "end": 342.723,
          "en": "or with help of the transform property, should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 344.13,
          "end": 344.963,
          "en": "And therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 344.963,
          "end": 347.39,
          "en": "besides the name of the property we wanna animate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 347.39,
          "end": 349.65,
          "en": "we also have to provide a duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 349.65,
          "end": 352.5,
          "en": "over which this animation should be done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 352.5,
          "end": 355.24,
          "en": "For example, 0.3 seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.24,
          "end": 356.31,
          "en": "Now, as a side note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 356.31,
          "end": 358.08,
          "en": "If you wanna learn more about that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.08,
          "end": 360.1,
          "en": "the potential values you can set up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 360.1,
          "end": 362.27,
          "en": "and how CSS animations work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 362.27,
          "end": 365.61,
          "en": "You might wanna check out a dedicated CSS course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 365.61,
          "end": 368.33,
          "en": "or some free CSS animation resources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 368.33,
          "end": 369.58,
          "en": "which you'll find out there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 369.58,
          "end": 372.48,
          "en": "I'll not dive too deeply into that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 372.48,
          "end": 374.89,
          "en": "since it's still a Vue course in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 374.89,
          "end": 378.963,
          "en": "and not primarily as CSS or CSS animations course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.13,
          "end": 382.97,
          "en": "Nonetheless here, we now animate changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 382.97,
          "end": 385.66,
          "en": "and transform over 0.3 seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.66,
          "end": 388.26,
          "en": "And we kind of find that easing function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.26,
          "end": 392.09000000000003,
          "en": "which basically determines how this animation accelerates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 392.09000000000003,
          "end": 395.39,
          "en": "and then throttles at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 395.39,
          "end": 398.87,
          "en": "If we now save that. You'll see if I click animate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
